## Upstream's `BaseNoiseFunctionComponent` enum is one flat object here, since a case object cannot
## repeat `input_index` across branches, and its `&'static XData` structs flatten into it. `noiseId`
## is an index into noise_parameter.aowl's `NoiseParameters`. Upstream's nested
## `&'static SplineRepr` becomes an index into `splines`, a per-stack arena; a self-recursive ref
## in a case object does not compile (COMPILER-BUGS.md bug 4). Component order and indices are
## upstream's exactly: see src/data_codegen/noise_routertest.aowl.

